{One system against the whole Sicilian instead of the Open Sicilian's library. Build the big centre with d4; if Black stops it with 2...d5 3.exd5 Qxd5 we are in a Scandinavian structure, and after 2...Nf6 3.e5 the same chain as the Advance lines. The Sicilian is only 15.3% here, so paying Open Sicilian theory for it would be the worst trade in the repertoire.}
